# index.html's inline theme script is allowed by a SHA-256 hash in vercel.json's
# Content-Security-Policy, and a hash is over the exact bytes served. Every checkout
# must therefore have the same line endings as the deployed file (LF): a Windows
# checkout converting to CRLF gave a different hash, so the hash on record was one
# the live site never matched and the browser blocked the script.
index.html text eol=lf
